{"id":"wb-5-116","name":"京师仓遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"京师仓遗址","text":"京师仓遗址位于中国陕西省华阴市城东10公里的卫峪乡段家城和王家城北面的瓦渣梁上，是西汉粮仓遗址，在2001年被中国政府列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n京师仓亦称“华仓”“西汉粮仓”，是西汉时期建造的一座大型储粮仓库，位于黄河与渭河交汇处附近，主要储存从关东运往长安的粮食。仓址所在地属于渭河南岸二级阶地，高出河滩50余米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%AC%E5%B8%88%E4%BB%93%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":90816337,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90816337","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5f9972cd7d146a2aa83d888f.jpg","title":"京师仓遗址保护石碑.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BA%AC%E5%B8%88%E4%BB%93%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E7%9F%B3%E7%A2%91.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/%E4%BA%AC%E5%B8%88%E4%BB%93%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E4%BF%9D%E6%8A%A4%E7%9F%B3%E7%A2%91.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Yoogwiki","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​京师仓遗址保护石碑","width":320,"height":235}}